1
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,200
Snowflakes fall in the golden sunlight.

2
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Snow drifts above the sea and wooded cliffs.

3
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
On a ladder, David pauses repairing a surveillance camera to watch the snow.

4
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,500
At the diner, Joyce stops wiping the counter and looks out at the snow.

5
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,500
In the science lab, Warren turns from his laptop toward the window.

6
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Kate cries alone in her room, covering her face with one hand.

7
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Frank opens the RV door, bong in hand. His dog Pompidou falls quiet.

8
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,500
Victoria tears down Rachel's missing poster, tosses it to the ground, then looks up.

9
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Principal Wells watches the snow from his office window, sipping whiskey.

10
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Jefferson looks up from his work in the empty photography classroom.

11
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,500
Nathan sits alone at a picnic table, looking down at a camera in his hands.

12
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:04,500
Red binders bear handwritten names. The last reads Rachel.
